# FreeBSD kernel-driver repo: LF line endings everywhere, no exceptions.
# This Windows checkout previously had core.autocrlf=true, which wrote CRLF
# into the working tree; FreeBSD /bin/sh and bmake reject CRLF files
# ("invalid option", "missing separator").  eol=lf overrides autocrlf for
# every clone of this repo, on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces: never let git normalize firmware blobs or binaries.
*.fw binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ko binary
